{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 38, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I arrived in Tokyo, I was struck by the city's vibrant energy and cutting-edge technology. The neon lights of Shinjuku's skyscrapers illuminated the night sky, and the hum of bullet trains whizzing by was a constant reminder of the country's incredible infrastructure.\n\nAs I explored the city, I was fascinated by the blend of traditional and modern culture. I visited the famous Tsukiji Fish Market, where I sampled the freshest sushi of my life, and wandered through the serene gardens of the Imperial Palace. In Kyoto, I marveled at the stunning temples and shrines, including the iconic Fushimi Inari Shrine, with its thousands of vermilion torii gates.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was experiencing Japan's unique food culture. I indulged in delicious ramen and tempura, and even tried some more adventurous dishes like okonomiyaki and takoyaki. The attention to detail and respect for tradition that went into every meal was impressive.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was struck by the kindness and hospitality of the people I met. From the friendly locals who helped me navigate the city to the chefs who shared their cooking techniques with me, everyone I encountered was eager to share their culture and traditions with me. My trip to Japan was a truly enriching experience that left me with unforgettable memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.47522157430648804}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.005332531873136759}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -6.556489552167477e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.20428094267845154}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -